{"id":10000101,"name":"基尼奇","enName":"Kinich","title":"回火之狩","element":"草","region":"纳塔","rarity":5,"weapon":"双手剑","birthday":"11月11日","constellation":"幻瑞兽座","description":"维茨特兰的猎龙人，精于度量代价。","affiliation":"维茨特兰","cv":{"chinese":"斑马&弭洋","japanese":"杉山纪彰&竹内顺子","english":"雅各布·高梨&阿比·埃斯皮里图","korean":"姜声宇&朴利娜"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000101-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000101-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Kinich.zip","voicePackageEn":"Kinich","quoteCount":77,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"基尼奇：「马力卜」的基尼奇，初次见面，告知委托内容时请附上你的出价。\n阿乔：…这就没了？哎呀，真急死我了！你该先宣扬自己干活多么迅速漂亮，说点你过往的优秀战绩，抬高对方的心理预期，然后再说「这值得配上一个更好的价码！」你到底会不会做生意？\n阿乔：一想到我伟大圣龙库胡勒阿乔竟然和你这个臭脸的呆瓜签订了契约，啊，真是丢人丢回上个时代了！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/78/efvk4hgsqq6xo8f6a09xnj7ynsow44d.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·阿乔","desc":"基尼奇：阿乔性情乖戾，多数时候，不必听信它的话。\n阿乔：基尼奇！！你有本事就放我出来——！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7c/iutav1p7cnayjelkzbi40rzjx9ubgzy.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·代价","desc":"激励与抚慰是别人的强项，度量「代价」则是我的做法。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/eeodcq5w9p7nlryw1fnoin1w1zb22vo.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·分配","desc":"七成调查，一成判断，剩下的用于出击。这是我分配精力的方式。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/ptfg27vcdqmcgmlt2helotjhrfc7en9.mp3"},{"title":"雨过天晴…","desc":"啧，裤脚还在滴水…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_weather_afterRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/q2ycv6fxr1uooq5bypkdi9z6tno316r.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"阿乔：是屁股会发光的虫子从天上掉下来了吗？才这么点光亮。\n基尼奇：我看你还没这只虫子亮。\n阿乔：你再说一遍？！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/hiezd6m5c4kouzkx9psvifdpqytpijt.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"阿乔：我有一副墨镜，但谁都不借。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/9aiydx4o7q86ddmfap03wafmexcdpwu.mp3"},{"title":"起风的时候…","desc":"阿乔：待壤土与沉云交汇，黑暗吞并旷野，吾将役使狂风呼啸，焚灼尘世！\n基尼奇：哼，你就「吹」吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_weather_breezy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/oijozlzh3myti29lndlaysj7ub4eujl.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"基尼奇：天气因素会提高极限运动的挑战性。\n阿乔：快跳一个嘛…我都忍不住看你去试了，呵呵呵呵。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1b/3km0po8j3dvqkz4bzh6uoe5l6rjfhq1.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"记得喝水。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/60/9j8lpfrhwdg8mgvdqio6blpdntqqmqb.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早。我正准备出门，天亮前不会回来。不用等我。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/cd4c6fduhqqfs7lema8o9gn0dxfz9ij.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"既然来了，随便吃点再走？给，用这个擦擦手。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/38m5m7wiz5viy38x3qqxbq9cp01v1ch.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"「今天」快要过去了。无论我是否对成果满意，事实都不会因此改变…接下去，该加快脚步了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/q2k7bgemkahkk5bt55517xqfp5rk9r4.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"篝火太呛了？稍等…好了，你休息吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/j7mmbn30e1qxe9b9ee9hwwtgknrdkl2.mp3"},{"title":"关于基尼奇自己·追捧","desc":"阿乔：基尼奇，你有没有反思过自己不受人们追捧的原因？看着月亮翻来覆去睡不着觉的时候，心里一定很苦恼吧？智慧圣龙库胡勒阿乔就在面前，汝为何不匍匐在地，乞求吾降下谕旨，为汝指点迷津呢？\n基尼奇：你一定是因为自己做得太好，才会让追随者们都想把你狠揍一顿。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/1s7pj53acliifbr74uk7er3m72xsh0s.mp3"},{"title":"关于基尼奇自己·猎龙人","desc":"身为猎龙人，我的职业特殊，并不能获得所有人的理解。但当矛盾难以化解，两全其美之策只存在于幻想中时，总得有人弄脏双手。只要价格合适，我不介意这个人是我自己。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1a/a9wrq3wuchteog30d952zfc6juj53ni.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·委托","desc":"基尼奇：如有需要，我可以为你分担冒险家协会的委托。\n阿乔：记得要最棘手、最刁钻，最好有生命危险的那种！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/8cck4m0x6psx35zkmsebd3qwk94kbkq.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·朋友","desc":"我知道阿乔另有图谋，但我并不介意为你涉险。我将凡事的代价挂在嘴边，但我相信这世上有些事可以不惜代价。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4b/iq2hmosvj5r5iac4uete5rd836jg0yg.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"使用「神之眼」无需代价。但不被置于明面的价格，结算时往往最为深重。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_pendant_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/s60pu596tdp1oehb60oixzplryp2xxi.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"「悬木人」崇尚不受约束的绝对自由，人与龙之间重在认可与帮助，不存在契约关系。我是个例外。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b8/ixmd5exnj29hqf33qw2ib8daq5yor2p.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"基尼奇：摘青蜜莓的时候，记得确认周围没有碍事的龙。\n阿乔：你这只吝啬的绿斑点蜥蜴！斤斤计较的爬虫！小气鬼！要不是我饿得前胸贴后背，谁看得起你手里那几个发烂发馊的破果子！\n基尼奇：那我自己吃了。\n阿乔：啊啊啊——你把我气红了！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/83/qpti4fexq5msqvmx0joelw2y5zy669u.mp3"},{"title":"关于玛薇卡…","desc":"一直以来，都是我索取别人的代价，直到火神大人用「还魂诗」将我从夜神之国送归。当作为支付「代价」的一方…我才完全体会到了它的含义。其于强者为筹码，其于弱者为赌注。关键的是，你是否有下注的胆量。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_teammate_mavuika_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/i5eh41giv6yq40pazlxqowvefgk3onu.mp3"},{"title":"关于玛拉妮…","desc":"我接过她的委托。她出钱让我担任「战斗顾问」，金额不菲，我答应了。但合作几次后，却看出她身手不赖。再三追问下，才知道所谓「战斗顾问」是要教授卡齐娜野外生存技巧…\n原来是和「自然」战斗。嗯，在我概念里，这叫「生活」。\n总之，这笔生意做完，我多了两位熟客。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_teammate_mualani_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/fvkc6ff64dghwifu23s5p9ok578hbu4.mp3"},{"title":"关于卡齐娜…","desc":"我见过和她有关的委托。「回声之子」里有些差劲的家伙嫉妒她拥有「古名」，拐弯抹角地雇人对她的龙伙伴下手。我已让他们付出了代价。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_teammate_kachina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/33/31atl3nu6ka9di6erzygrrsi8oveljo.mp3"},{"title":"关于恰斯卡…","desc":"我见过她处理委托。我们对于解决争端的手段存在分歧。通常我会让一方彻底闭嘴，但她会让两方都说不出话，等到他们终于能在病床上开口的时候，早就忘了为何争执。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_teammate_chasca_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/plnw5vt86oyrdp586f0rcmmo8p4f1bo.mp3"},{"title":"关于希诺宁…","desc":"有次我路过「回声之子」，看到了一个奇怪的委托。委托人希望得到一种好养的植物。我把肉龙掌的种子送了过去，配了花盆和肥料。这种植物分布广泛，在荒野上都长势旺盛。可我过段时间去拿报酬的时候，才发现盆里连小苗都没长出来。\n我为高估希诺宁的园艺能力支付了代价。这是我为数不多以失败而告终的委托。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_teammate_xilonen_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/pzp1qkwup3wcnbhaj6m80k009t70ieh.mp3"},{"title":"关于伊安珊…","desc":"基尼奇：我接过她的委托，或说合作…这位运动教练经常为学员制作健身餐，计算热量精确到个位数，为此需要进购质量达标、规格精确的果实。稍微长了点斑，或者被虫咬过一口都不行。其他人觉得委托内容过于挑剔，但我恰好拥有不错的眼力，以及稳定的残次品消耗渠道。\n阿乔：等等？你是说…我的果汁？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_teammate_iansan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/3qa10qs92cmuhwuy7a7zheivairn2ei.mp3"},{"title":"关于茜特菈莉…","desc":"或许你猜到了，我也接过她的委托，帮她从一位稻妻商人处购买一摞摞沉重的纸制阅读品。我无意打探雇主隐私，可「烟谜主」的读物，不是缝在织物上的吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_teammate_citlali_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/9as2dgxiyc0tgdj8waxbngytujgdh0z.mp3"},{"title":"关于伊法…","desc":"基尼奇：我委托过他。有次阿乔说自己「病」了，大哭大闹不肯停下。既然如此，理应送它去看最好的龙医生。他医术的确不错，阿乔被请进诊所后没一会儿就痊愈了。\n阿乔：你…你知道什么啊你！他就是个庸医，庸医！…你、你都不知道他说了什么你都！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_teammate_ifa_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/84/6tre5ycp1gesj53q8mvnu7nba3di8sd.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解基尼奇·其一","desc":"我是个猎龙人。无龙可猎的时候，也接其他委托。和你算是同行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3d/m315q38dphiodmm4iabgbkn8koo1f3b.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解基尼奇·其二","desc":"从前我替人跑腿送信，收件人经常喊我「顺手帮个忙」。那么「顺手」值多少钱呢？往往我一开价，忙就不用帮了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/r4ggqjzybmkr51jq7t0hcoj5gdf2o7d.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解基尼奇·其三","desc":"第一次猎龙，我做了数以周计的准备。光观察、跟踪和蹲守就花费数日，制作了不下三种陷阱，还记录了它的生活规律和食物偏好…\n很多努力是浪费，但浪费是必要的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2c/1fh8gva09mk5wdiavcab8jljj0wpcf5.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解基尼奇·其四","desc":"基尼奇：阿乔曾被封印在古老的遗迹中，我与它签订契约，将它放了出来。\n阿乔：谁知道你这个看起来就会一头栽进泥水沟的家伙，现在还活得好好的…算了算了，我烈焰之国至高领主有的是与地位相衬的美德与涵养。\n基尼奇：美德与涵养催促你天天盼我死？\n阿乔：我指的是有耐心和时间！\n基尼奇：…总之，只要掐准软肋，邪恶之物也能加以利用。\n阿乔：你个可恶的基尼奇！我今天就要借别人的手弄死你！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/mphyu8rp5jlckqmpm1nb2cpxz0q2ouj.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解基尼奇·其五","desc":"迄今我都在和「代价」打交道，从大灵处获得古名「回火」——也就是「马力卜」，我并不意外。\n生存才能创造价值，我不会期待一切走向终结的那一天。但作为「回火」的持有者，我早有接受它灼烧的准备。\n它大可审视我的一生，而我不会留下遗憾。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/rm2p5ya1pdzpap84p1av8gla3919sh1.mp3"},{"title":"基尼奇的爱好…","desc":"我会尝试各类极限运动，玩腻了就换一种。在磨炼技巧的同时与恐惧感博弈…先是「面对」，而后「习惯」，最终「征服」。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/tc55dpgptqpqy5rxoxjwbz3bf1c6cqg.mp3"},{"title":"基尼奇的烦恼…","desc":"我见过有烦恼的人不是想得太多就是想得太少。我总在为自己寻找下一个目标与落点，没闲心烦恼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/aw10m7qhxgjyuxn0bgizg2dlu1c3kc8.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"基尼奇：在野外，我一般什么方便吃什么。最好的选择自然是肉和水果。\n阿乔：哟，装得像个不挑食的好孩子，我怎么从不见你摘颗粒果呀？\n基尼奇：背着重。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3b/alnie4jw19gwpc7qgqnwgw00oc4dqsg.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"阿乔：生冷辛辣侵蚀尊贵圣躯，热油浊气有害五脏六腑。硬实之物不便咀嚼，酥软烂糊食之无味…\n基尼奇：你到底要吃什么？\n阿乔：当然是你的灵魂喽，噢呵呵呵。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f3/1jwr0fss24lugvifkkswk8mdtmoq7iv.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"基尼奇：很美味。我应该给你相应酬劳，或是其他你中意的回礼。\n阿乔：吐出来！你这个贪婪的蝮蛇！那里面肯定有给我的份！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/jdkzqvz2xpcs1jgasp9h454sxalgvlc.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"基尼奇：还不错，比我预想中的味道更好。\n阿乔：这话难道不是在嘲笑你吗？在他心中，你就像个不会做饭的家伙呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/41/53nlkns96f19tm205b4obtk2ymbkpbi.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"基尼奇：…可以不付钱吗？\n阿乔：别还回去啊！我还没尝过呢！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ef/31r6bz9q665e9jezcx38zm0qmxnm9vj.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"基尼奇：阿乔？\n阿乔：知道了知道了，嘁，差使别人干活的时候积极得就跟拿钱一样，有本事你自己长出翅膀飞上天啊。你，说的就是你，还不快点到我背上来？能乘上伟大圣龙库胡勒阿乔可是值得你称道一生的殊荣。\n基尼奇：放心，只是一次轻松的丛林旅行。跟着我就好。路线我设计过，保证安全。\n阿乔：别忘了你答应我的好处！\n基尼奇：现在，第一步是跳上去…生日快乐。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/7xst4ycwm5kdue16g6lsk3ba8wd9p4d.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"选刀，只需要坚硬、锋利。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/6cv2kv63b9wc4yj40jnzjnd8n0dmx2y.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"理包，优先考虑精简、轻便…好比这柄伞就是多余的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/j7zh98bkn5mknt8kg8dnb1oxrregrsn.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"行动前，我会绑紧头巾，提醒自己保持冷静和矫健。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/ph14m5u020gdgf4ya90vvdnwq20zacd.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"你为我做了很多，我不会白白收下。你可以主动开价，或是接受我提供的回报…我以「马力卜」之名许诺，哪种选择都不会亏待你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/00/cpuloh5fufiukspc8fmfkilzr7lyfdr.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"阿乔：算你灵活。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_ajaw_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/ab5u631o7yics0ptuhkclbveynizck9.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"阿乔：这就溜了？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_ajaw_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/j2wjtmm0b7tb35hda9q2x9nfevnzquj.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"阿乔：用来用去就这两招…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_ajaw_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b1/3hvlnfsncrjtnslkote3x2bhss1t0tb.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"目标上钩。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/60j19g23wqlnv7rs8mft7q6qldt66ew.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"发现猎物。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/3cwunfo6v0w8u2qd3sm6u89n2sbx0o1.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其六","desc":"封锁退路。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill1_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/49/f4axapzx9bnoidpz7fw0b0pucw4rnbp.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"报偿夜神。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/83/3o89ijsopc6wsb1xvdfr2jbhfkov28f.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"领他们上路。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/43/4uxhe9ytbyyt2a2ocg4ionpx8lab40q.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"往昔之影，奉我之命。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/27ushlbj5mx74xo46ywojjb8o5qbpai.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其四","desc":"阿乔：圣龙君临！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill3_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a7/hcpifbif67eqdeyvy93hqbrj7cuid09.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其五","desc":"阿乔：原灵现示！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill3_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/9o1hjrzc6rp68c3rahgs5m9gvopmmi9.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其六","desc":"阿乔：圣龙烈焰，将照彻汝等腐朽。\n阿乔：我烧烧烧烧烧。\n阿乔：啊哈！真是快活！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill3_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/75/6p72gqgm5oxeamxyxk7ri63jqko04qj.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其七","desc":"阿乔：汝之灵魂，应当供奉于吾。\n阿乔：哈？连声都不敢吭？\n阿乔：那就再也别吭声啦！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill3_07","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/rzt6baah9xnkjxxlap9w1uxv0zko1h2.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其八","desc":"阿乔：吾之威光，无人能及！无可比拟！\n阿乔：更何况我现在心情不好。\n阿乔：渺小虫豸，付出代价吧！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_skill3_08","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/9qlibw00f26ihvfx2y8j5les3u7x6rz.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"基尼奇：见者有份？\n阿乔：这种破烂你居然想要。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/cd0fc37larmv6ytagl5az84mij96u1q.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"基尼奇：万物皆有其用。\n阿乔：你是从小吃不饱饭？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/42/phoctjvqy51z3x8dpol0bofhv25th1a.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"阿乔：嘁，才这么点穷酸玩意。\n基尼奇：不拿就走，话真多。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a5/742d4wqswfm0qxrt0wmz7o2fcqkkn36.mp3"},{"title":"打开风之翼·其一","desc":"…非用不可吗？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_explore_fly_start_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/5esrbl6nc9wfl3lby4birfwjwfzbzpt.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"该你偿还代价了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/ddgtbb4i3lpso7fszgsjzcj5hivlukh.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"将计就计…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2d/app3rqvyq2icztwfhjcd7fytfb3cifg.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"阿乔：基尼奇，快完蛋，快完蛋。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/2cbbusqawywcv44yidz1qtm2k434y1f.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"你知道自己处境不妙吧？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/g1ypu2lcnyzsnnmvvdxoybn5wyewqn2.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"我们来谈谈价格吧？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/j7l2tn93tudh5ulzj5huuqoqsfz3udr.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"不要…回头…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/p6w3etkmqtlmfpwny550hjvvgjo30sr.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"凡事皆有代价…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d2/kq5lhkh0lqt3xa8of547j5h8l37qufd.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"阿乔：呵呵…不错的交易…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/21/t5hooggre8egeydaddfms79g8d7gt54.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"失手。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/9mezn2b30e6b4h3dbodi1u9pi9plp3o.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"意外…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kinich/vo_kinich_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/eb/bguycipdc8jejwnyk6szcb4j6vxh0fv.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"成交，我接手了。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kinich_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/gqen3dk9oi52bquzqi4tzzwqvo0kmqu.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"我来解决。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kinich_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/jfiqin4omfiv82qhei5nvj7kaesqfdl.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"祝我们合作愉快。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kinich_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/bwrnykqvpvpde2s1z1edv16iotsmjp8.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000101-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000101-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1188,"fullArtHeight":947}